        <item>
            <title>1.1.18</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 17:43:02 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>20</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.18</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>SnapUI 1.1.18: more is blurred before it leaves. Keys written as hex, passwords inside links and webhook addresses are now caught; a recording is read from start to finish before its movie can be dragged out; phone shots are checked as they arrive; and Claude Code and History wait for a shot's blur to be saved before handing it out.</p>
]]></description>
